# Level 11 — the route (docs/drahtseilakt/autopilot-rules.md): sectors, stretches in order, the ball, the action.
# From the walkthrough's storyboard (ref/video/frames/fast/level11); the plan and hints made from it are
# Level_11.plan and Level_11.txt.

sector 1 wood
  start → east → P_Trafo_Stone_01                                    pass into it → stone
  the wavy log south along x 61, the wavy log east along z -135      press at a steady push (a stone ball stopped in a
                                                                     trough cannot climb out); round the corner slowly
  off the log north down onto the plateau                            pass
  P_Ball_Stone_03 → the notch at x 123                               ram north from a short run-up, braking: it rolls
                                                                     down the rails round into the disc of the pusher
                                                                     P_Modul_01_01, whose block slides west
  the notch at x 114, the rails down into the castle maze            pass
  P_Modul_25_01 / 25_02 (planks standing at the floor's sides)       ram west, then east, braking: they fall across
                                                                     the gaps
  north → the target of P_Modul_37_01                                target → its bridge falls across the north row
  east, down the step into the lane x 121, north → the disc of the   press into it → its block slides out of the row
  pusher P_Modul_01_02
  back to z -56, east, up the ramp along x 128 over the pusher's     pass; press over the block (its rod lies across
  block, west over both fallen planks                                the way)
  north along x 90 past the swinging sacks P_Modul_26_01/02          pass (a sack only while in the way)
  east along the north row over the target's bridge, the loose       pass
  P_Ball_Stone_06 pushed ahead
  down the plank A01_Modul02 → over the gap → PC_TwoFlames_01        press at speed (its end is a ramp over the gap)

sector 2 stone
  CP1 east, south along x 310 → P_Trafo_Paper_01                     pass into it → paper
  P_Modul_18_01 (fan) → the upper track                              wait over the grate → lifted
  rails, the seesaw P_Modul_30_01 → P_Trafo_Wood_01                  pass → wood
  south over the flipping planks, east z -128, x 386 → P_Trafo_Stone_02  pass → stone
  row z -108.5 east: the crate of P_Modul_34_01 under the block      ram twice from x 430, braking → the block sinks
  x 386.5 north, z -68.5 east over the flat flap of P_Modul_19_01    pass
  row z -57.5 to x 420: the drawbridge P_Modul_25_03                 hold, ram south, brake
  back, row z -83.5 east (tips the other flap flat)                  press
  the target of P_Modul_37_02 at the row's east end                  target → its bridge falls into the lane x 443.5
  x 420: the drawbridge P_Modul_25_04                                hold, ram north, brake; north over both planks
  z -57.5 east, lane x 443.5 south over the target's bridge          pass, press
  → P_Trafo_Wood_03 → PC_TwoFlames_02                                pass → wood

sector 3 wood
  → P_Trafo_Stone_03, down the twisted slide past the sack 26_03     pass → stone
  the grid: the crates under the column's blocks P_Modul_34_03/02     ram from x 677.5, five times each, braking
  (channels z -196.5, -212)
  the rail loop up, the column top x 689.5 south, down to the bottom pass
  row
  the bottom channel's crate (block P_Modul_34_04)                   ram eight times
  → P_Trafo_Paper_02                                                 pass → paper
  the rail loop, the column top south, the rails round to x 720      pass, press → P_Trafo_Wood_06 → wood
  row z -156, x 759.5 south, west, the seesaw P_Modul_30_02 south    press slowly (faster flips the plank over)
  → P_Trafo_Stone_04                                                 → stone
  the seesaw back north                                              press at a steady push
  row z -156: P_Ball_Stone_10 rammed, pushed up to x 807             ram, then press slowly: it rolls on along the
                                                                     rail into the target of P_Modul_37_03
  x 809.5 south over the flaps P_Modul_19_03, round to the lane      pass
  x 876, north over the target's bridge → PC_TwoFlames_03            press, pass

sector 4 stone
  → P_Trafo_Wood_05                                                  pass into it → wood
  the rails up into the zigzag corridors, the bubble platform        pass
  (P_Extra_Point_10)
  its rail pair south past P_Trafo_Wood_04, down to the lowest floor pass
  the pockets west of the lane x 1093: the discs of P_Modul_01_04/03 ram east, six times each from x 1078.5
  north over the arched bridge, the row z -54 east, the rails' bend  pass
  south onto the platform z -91
  the target of P_Modul_37_04 at its west end                        target → its bridge falls into the lane's gap
  back up the rails, west to the junction                            press up the rails, pass
  the row of tipping boxes P_Modul_41 north as wood                  pass at speed: they tip, it drops onto the rails
  the rails round to the corridor x 998, its corner                  pass
  the drawbridge P_Modul_25_07 at the corner's west side             ram west from x 1006, braking → it falls west
  the rails → P_Trafo_Paper_03                                       pass into it → paper
  back over the fallen plank, north along x 998, the rows z -13, z 6 pass
  the box row south (it holds a paper ball), the junction, east,     pass
  the pier x 1093 south over the target's bridge, the lane past the
  pushers
  the fans P_Modul_18_02..04 in a row along x 1113.3                 hold over each grate until lifted, then on to the
                                                                     next fast → PC_TwoFlames_04

sector 5 paper
  off the checkpoint platform south over P_Modul_18_05, past 18_06   pass; onto the lower rail pair (x 1113.5)
  south into the loop over P_Modul_18_07                             lifted onto the upper pair
  the upper pair north, its hairpin, the pair x 1129.5 south         pass round the hairpin, press south
  the loop over P_Modul_18_08                                        lifted; press on north over its top
  the top rails round east, the S of A05_Rail_02 (P_Extra_Point_13)  pass, cruise
  east along z -344.5 to the rails' end                              pass
  P_Modul_08_01 (crate), P_Modul_18_09, P_Modul_08_02 (crate)        wait in the crate; lifted into the next one
  the floor → PC_TwoFlames_05                                        pass

sector 6 paper
  the long floor east → P_Trafo_Stone_06                             pass into it → stone
  the floor's end onto A06_Rail_01 down to the stepped grid          pass
  the grid's top, column x 1563: P_Ball_Stone_12 and _11              knock each east a little below its middle, braking
                                                                     at once: 12 drops onto the track z -439.6 and
                                                                     pushes the pusher P_Modul_01_05 south; 11 drops
                                                                     onto the track z -449.5 and opens the trapdoor
                                                                     P_Modul_19_04 of the west platform
  down the grid to its south foot, the rails west and north          pass
  slowly up into the block in the bridge's middle                    press slowly: it stops against the pusher's disc
  east over the seesaw P_Modul_30_04                                 back off a little, then press at speed (from a
                                                                     standstill the stone does not get over its pivot)
  → P_Trafo_Paper_05                                                 pass into it → paper
  back west over both seesaws, past the boxes P_Box_05/06            pass
  through the open trapdoor onto A06_Rail_04 → P_Modul_18_12 (fan)   wait over the grate → lifted
  → P_Trafo_Wood_09                                                  pass → wood
  the zigzag of rail pairs A06_Rail_05 (x 1460, z -583, x 1476,       press each pair at speed 10–12, leaning on the
  z -606, x 1448, z -631.5)                                          upper rail, to carry onto the next
  the platform → PE_Balloon_01                                       pass
